{"seq":2,"slug":"hypothesis-inference","title":"假设检验与统计推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/hypothesis-inference","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"假设检验与统计推断\">假设检验与统计推断</h1><p>「p 值小于 0.05，所以有效」——这句话每天在无数报告里出现，而其中相当一部分是误用。假设检验是统计推断最常用也最常被误解的工具：p 值不是「假设为真的概率」，置信区间不是「真值落在区间内的概率」，不显著也不等于「没有效应」。R 把各类检验封装得极其简便，但工具越顺手，越需要使用者理解背后的逻辑。本篇不堆砌函数列表，而是讲清假设检验的共同骨架、几类经典检验的适用场景、以及那些最容易让人栽跟头的概念陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>几乎所有经典假设检验都遵循同一套逻辑骨架：立零假设、算检验统计量、在零假设下看这个统计量有多极端、据此得 p 值。下图展示这条推断链。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[研究问题] --&gt; B[设立零假设 H0&lt;br/&gt;与备择假设 H1]&#10;  B --&gt; C[选检验统计量&lt;br/&gt;如 t, F, 卡方]&#10;  C --&gt; D[在 H0 为真的假设下&lt;br/&gt;推导统计量的分布]&#10;  D --&gt; E[计算 p 值&lt;br/&gt;比观测更极端的概率]&#10;  E --&gt; F{p &lt; 显著性水平?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[拒绝 H0]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[不拒绝 H0&lt;br/&gt;注意: 非接受]&#10;  D --&gt; I[置信区间&lt;br/&gt;另一面的同一信息]\">flowchart TD\n  A[研究问题] --&gt; B[设立零假设 H0&lt;br/&gt;与备择假设 H1]\n  B --&gt; C[选检验统计量&lt;br/&gt;如 t, F, 卡方]\n  C --&gt; D[在 H0 为真的假设下&lt;br/&gt;推导统计量的分布]\n  D --&gt; E[计算 p 值&lt;br/&gt;比观测更极端的概率]\n  E --&gt; F{p &lt; 显著性水平?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[拒绝 H0]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[不拒绝 H0&lt;br/&gt;注意: 非接受]\n  D --&gt; I[置信区间&lt;br/&gt;另一面的同一信息]</pre><p>下表汇总常见检验及其适用场景，选检验的核心是「数据类型 + 比较结构」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检验</th>\n<th>R 函数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>零假设</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单样本 t 检验</td>\n<td><code>t.test(x, mu=)</code></td>\n<td>均值是否等于某值</td>\n<td>均值=μ₀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双样本 t 检验</td>\n<td><code>t.test(x, y)</code></td>\n<td>两组均值是否相等</td>\n<td>两均值相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配对 t 检验</td>\n<td><code>t.test(x, y, paired=TRUE)</code></td>\n<td>配对前后差异</td>\n<td>差值均值=0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方差分析</td>\n<td><code>aov</code> / <code>anova</code></td>\n<td>多组均值是否相等</td>\n<td>各组均值相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡方检验</td>\n<td><code>chisq.test</code></td>\n<td>分类变量关联</td>\n<td>相互独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关检验</td>\n<td><code>cor.test</code></td>\n<td>两连续变量相关</td>\n<td>相关系数=0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"假设检验的共同骨架\">假设检验的共同骨架</h2><p>理解一个检验，不必死记函数，只需把它放进这套通用框架。先设零假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（通常是「无差异/无效应」这种保守立场）和备择假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。然后构造一个检验统计量，它在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真时有已知分布。最后看实际数据算出的统计量在这个分布下有多「极端」——比它更极端的概率就是 p 值。</p>\n<p>p 值的精确含义是：<strong>假定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真</strong>，观测到当前或更极端数据的概率。它小，说明数据与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不太相容，于是我们倾向拒绝 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。注意这是一个反证法式的逻辑，它<strong>不</strong>告诉你 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真的概率，也不告诉你效应有多大。这一框架与 <a href=\"statistical-models\">线性与广义线性模型</a> 中每个系数的 p 值是同一套逻辑——那里检验的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「该系数为零」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"t-检验-比较均值\">t 检验：比较均值</h2><p>t 检验是最常用的检验，用于比较均值。R 的 <code>t.test</code> 一个函数覆盖单样本、双样本、配对三种情形，通过参数切换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 双样本: 两组的某指标均值是否有差异&#10;t.test(extra ~ group, data = sleep)&#10;&#10;# 配对: 同一批对象处理前后&#10;t.test(before, after, paired = TRUE)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 双样本: 两组的某指标均值是否有差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t.test(extra ~ group, data = sleep)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 配对: 同一批对象处理前后</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>t.test(before, after, paired = TRUE)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出包含 t 统计量、自由度、p 值和<strong>置信区间</strong>。一个关键实践建议：相比只看 p 值，更应关注置信区间和效应量。p = 0.04 和 p = 0.0001 在「是否拒绝」上同档，但效应大小可能天差地别。双样本 t 检验默认用 Welch 校正（不假设两组等方差），这通常比假设等方差的经典版本更稳健。当样本量小且正态假设可疑时，可改用非参数的 Wilcoxon 检验，或用 <a href=\"resampling-bootstrap\">重抽样、自助法与模拟</a> 中的置换检验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方差分析与卡方检验\">方差分析与卡方检验</h2><p>当要比较<strong>多于两组</strong>的均值时，反复做两两 t 检验会膨胀假阳性率——这正是「多重比较」问题。方差分析（ANOVA）用一个 F 检验同时检验「所有组均值相等」，再在拒绝后做事后两两比较。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"fit &lt;- aov(weight ~ group, data = PlantGrowth)&#10;summary(fit)                    # F 检验&#10;TukeyHSD(fit)                   # 事后比较, 已校正多重性\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fit &#x3C;- aov(weight ~ group, data = PlantGrowth)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(fit)                    # F 检验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>TukeyHSD(fit)                   # 事后比较, 已校正多重性</span></span></code></pre></div><p>方差分析本质是线性模型的特例（<code>aov</code> 内部就是 <code>lm</code>），这呼应了 <a href=\"statistical-models\">线性与广义线性模型</a> 的统一视角。卡方检验则处理<strong>分类变量</strong>：<code>chisq.test</code> 检验列联表中两个分类变量是否独立，或观测频数是否符合某理论分布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"chisq.test(table(survey$smoke, survey$exercise))   # 独立性检验\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>chisq.test(table(survey$smoke, survey$exercise))   # 独立性检验</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"置信区间与-p-值的关系\">置信区间与 p 值的关系</h2><p>置信区间和 p 值常被当成两件事，实则是同一枚硬币的两面。一个 95% 置信区间是「与数据相容的参数取值范围」；若这个区间不包含零假设值（如 0），则对应的双侧检验在 0.05 水平显著。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"ci &lt;- t.test(x, y)$conf.int     # 均值差的 95% 置信区间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ci &#x3C;- t.test(x, y)$conf.int     # 均值差的 95% 置信区间</span></span></code></pre></div><p>置信区间往往比 p 值信息更丰富，因为它同时传达了<strong>效应方向、大小和精度</strong>，而 p 值只给「是否显著」这一个比特。一个 95% 置信区间 <code>[0.1, 0.2]</code>（窄、远离 0）和 <code>[0.01, 5.0]</code>（宽、勉强排除 0）可能 p 值相近，但实质结论大不相同。现代统计实践越来越强调报告区间与效应量，而非孤立的 p 值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误读与多重比较\">常见误读与多重比较</h2><p>假设检验的陷阱大多在概念而非语法，以下几条最致命：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>p 值不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真的概率</strong>，它是「在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下数据这么极端的概率」，方向恰相反。</li>\n<li><strong>不显著 ≠ 无效应</strong>。p &gt; 0.05 只说明「证据不足以拒绝」，可能是真没效应，也可能是样本量太小、检验力不够。「没有证据」不等于「证据表明没有」。</li>\n<li><strong>多重比较膨胀假阳性</strong>。做 20 个独立检验，即便都无真效应，期望也有约 1 个「显著」。需要用 Bonferroni、Benjamini-Hochberg（FDR）等方法校正。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"p_adjust &lt;- p.adjust(p_values, method = &quot;BH&quot;)   # 控制错误发现率\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>p_adjust &#x3C;- p.adjust(p_values, method = \"BH\")   # 控制错误发现率</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>效应量与显著性是两回事</strong>。大样本下微不足道的效应也能「显著」；务必结合实际意义判断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当解析检验的假设难以满足，或想避开这些理论分布的依赖时，下一篇的重抽样方法提供了一条用计算换假设的稳健路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>检验的共同骨架：设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → 算检验统计量 → 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下看其分布 → 得 p 值 → 据显著性水平决策。</li>\n<li>p 值是「假定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真时数据这么极端的概率」，不是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为真的概率」。</li>\n<li>t 检验比较均值（Welch 校正更稳健），ANOVA 比较多组（F 检验 + 事后 TukeyHSD），卡方检验查分类变量关联。</li>\n<li>置信区间与 p 值是一体两面，但区间额外传达效应的方向、大小与精度，信息更丰富。</li>\n<li>三大陷阱：不显著≠无效应、p 值方向易误读、多重比较需校正（<code>p.adjust</code>）。</li>\n<li>假设难满足时转向 <a href=\"resampling-bootstrap\">重抽样、自助法与模拟</a>；系数检验呼应 <a href=\"statistical-models\">线性与广义线性模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"假设检验与统计推断","id":"假设检验与统计推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"假设检验的共同骨架","id":"假设检验的共同骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"t 检验：比较均值","id":"t-检验-比较均值"},{"level":2,"text":"方差分析与卡方检验","id":"方差分析与卡方检验"},{"level":2,"text":"置信区间与 p 值的关系","id":"置信区间与-p-值的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误读与多重比较","id":"常见误读与多重比较"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线性与广义线性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/statistical-models"},"next":{"title":"重抽样、自助法与模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/resampling-bootstrap"}}